Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:45.00,TitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,MEU MAIOR ORGULHO AGORA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.04,0:00:03.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Ai, ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:05.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Eu ainda tenho que focar no seu projeto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:09.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Deixa eu mostrar pra vocês o meu orgulhozinho,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:11.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,que é meu site 5 que eu tô fazendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:15.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Não sei se vai dar pra ver direito, mas ó.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:18.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Ó.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Aí ó.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,É melhor assim, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Tá bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:27.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Tá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Vai ser assim, então.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:30.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Tá, melhor, melhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Melhor, melhor, melhor, que dá pra mim o gosto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:35.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Olha, meu sitezinho que eu tô fazendo, gente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:36.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Meu maior orgulhozinho, ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Cadê?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Ai, gente, ó.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.04,0:00:43.04,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Tá, meu, deixa eu voltar a ele.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.00,SubtitleMinimal,,0,0,0,,Tem que lá não agater a minha, ele.
